      "message": "the definition from english dictionary: \"combine or cause to combine to form a single entity.\"\n\nzmake works by taking build configs from the various aspects of a project (i.e., base configuration, toolchain, RO/RW selection, etc) and progressively merging them together to produce a single configuration, which is what gets used when cmake runs.\n\nThe definition is rather simple: https://chromium.git.corp.google.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4e950b9fde9e5d7197d2558f7a36bc809e193a49/zephyr/zmake/zmake/build_config.py#58",
